1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,686
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? — N5 grammatikasining toʻliq xulosasi.

2
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:16,290
Videoning qaysidir joyida yapon tilida savol beriladi. Agar eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

3
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:19,718
1-qism: Sevimli taomlar va tushlik rejalari

4
00:00:19,718 --> 00:00:26,518
Suzuki-san, yapon taomlari ichida eng koʻp nima yoqadi?

5
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:31,212
Menga eng koʻp suşi yoqadi.

6
00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:33,814
Tanaka-san, siz-chi?

7
00:00:33,837 --> 00:00:39,437
Menga suşidan koʻra ramen yoqadi.

8
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:43,678
Ayniqsa, soya sousli ramenni yaxshi koʻraman.

9
00:00:43,701 --> 00:00:47,572
Soya sousli ramen juda mazali ekan, shundaymi?

10
00:00:47,596 --> 00:00:51,962
Menga miso ramen ham yoqadi.

11
00:00:51,985 --> 00:00:55,752
Miso ramen ham yaxshi ekan.

12
00:00:55,775 --> 00:01:00,868
Suzuki-san, tushlikni allaqachon yedingizmi?

13
00:01:00,892 --> 00:01:04,825
Yoʻq, hali yemedim.

14
00:01:04,848 --> 00:01:08,288
Tanaka-san, siz yedingizmi?

15
00:01:08,312 --> 00:01:12,926
Yoʻq, men ham hali yemedim.

16
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:18,083
Unda, stansiya yaqinidagi ramen doʻkoniga boramizmi?

17
00:01:18,106 --> 00:01:20,377
Yaxshi fikr!

18
00:01:20,401 --> 00:01:23,834
U yer mashhur doʻkonmi?

19
00:01:23,857 --> 00:01:27,824
Ha, televideniyeda aytishgan.

20
00:01:27,847 --> 00:01:32,580
Har doim koʻp odam navbatda turarmish.

21
00:01:32,603 --> 00:01:36,537
Ish kunlarining tushlik vaqtida odam kam boʻladi.

22
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:40,365
Ehtimol, tezda kirishimiz mumkin.

23
00:01:40,388 --> 00:01:42,421
Shundaymi?

24
00:01:42,444 --> 00:01:45,678
Unda, hozir boramiz.

25
00:01:45,701 --> 00:01:48,834
Mening mashinamda boramiz.

26
00:01:48,857 --> 00:01:50,509
Rahmat.

27
00:01:50,533 --> 00:01:54,032
Tanaka-san, yaxshi hayday olasizmi?

28
00:01:54,055 --> 00:01:55,791
Ha.

29
00:01:55,815 --> 00:02:00,782
Har kuni haydab turaman, shuning uchun yaxshi bilaman.

30
00:02:00,805 --> 00:02:03,176
Xavotir olmang.

31
00:02:03,199 --> 00:02:05,657
Bu yaxshi yangilik.

32
00:02:05,681 --> 00:02:12,647
Menga haydashni umuman bilmayman, shuning uchun hasad qilaman.

33
00:02:12,670 --> 00:02:16,037
Suzuki-san, sizda mashina yoʻqmi?

34
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:19,426
Ha, yoʻq.

35
00:02:19,449 --> 00:02:23,383
Har doim elektr poyezdi va avtobusda yuraman.

36
00:02:23,406 --> 00:02:29,039
A, u yerda ramen doʻkonining reklamasi koʻrinib turibdi!

37
00:02:29,062 --> 00:02:31,197
Rostdan ham!

38
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:34,994
Koʻk reklama taxtasi boʻlgan doʻkonmi?

39
00:02:35,017 --> 00:02:38,184
Ha, shu.

40
00:02:38,207 --> 00:02:42,340
Doʻkon oldida toʻxtash joyi bor ekan.

41
00:02:42,363 --> 00:02:48,260
Bugun mashinalar kam, shuning uchun oson toʻxtaymiz.

42
00:02:48,284 --> 00:02:50,250
Yaxshi boʻldi.

43
00:02:50,273 --> 00:02:55,078
Qorni ochib qoldi, koʻp yeymoqchiman.

44
00:02:55,102 --> 00:02:59,944
Ha, katta ramen buyurtma qilamiz.

45
00:02:59,967 --> 00:03:07,072
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori izohda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

46
00:03:07,072 --> 00:03:10,072
2-qism: Dam olish kunini qanday oʻtkazish kerak

47
00:03:10,072 --> 00:03:15,639
Suzuki-san, dam olish kunlarida nima qilishni yaxshi koʻrasiz?

48
00:03:15,662 --> 00:03:20,795
Men uyda film tomosha qilishni yaxshi koʻraman.

49
00:03:20,818 --> 00:03:23,290
Tanaka-san, siz-chi?

50
00:03:23,313 --> 00:03:29,157
Men doʻstlarim bilan Kiotoga sayohat qilishni yaxshi koʻraman.

51
00:03:29,181 --> 00:03:32,147
Kioto juda qiziqarli joy ekan.

52
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:34,304
Kyoto, shundaymi?

53
00:03:34,327 --> 00:03:36,093
Yaxshi fikr!

54
00:03:36,116 --> 00:03:41,367
Kyotoda juda koʻp qadimiy ibodatxonalar bor, shunday emasmi?

55
00:03:41,391 --> 00:03:47,243
Ha, Suzuki-san, siz Kyoto shahriga borganmisiz?

56
00:03:47,266 --> 00:03:52,717
Yoʻq, men hech qachon borganim yoʻq.

57
00:03:52,741 --> 00:03:55,274
Qachondir borib koʻrishni xohlardim.

58
00:03:55,297 --> 00:03:59,387
Unda, navbatdagi dam olish kunimizda boramizmi?

59
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:02,977
Shinkansen bilan boradigan boʻlsak, tez yetib olamiz.

60
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,414
Shinkansenmi?

61
00:04:05,437 --> 00:04:10,370
Tokyodan Kyoto shahrigacha qancha vaqt ketadi?

62
00:04:10,393 --> 00:04:13,560
Ikki yarim soat atrofida ketadi.

63
00:04:13,583 --> 00:04:15,949
Juda tez, shundaymi?

64
00:04:15,972 --> 00:04:20,506
Ikki yarim soatmi? Tez ekan!

65
00:04:20,529 --> 00:04:24,866
Lekin Shinkansen biroz qimmat boʻladi, shundaymi?

66
00:04:24,889 --> 00:04:28,223
Ha, biroz qimmatroq.

67
00:04:28,246 --> 00:04:34,846
Lekin, tezyurar avtobusga qaraganda Shinkansen tezroq va qulayroq.

68
00:04:34,868 --> 00:04:36,645
Shunday, rostdan ham.

69
00:04:36,669 --> 00:04:40,302
Kyotoda qayerda toʻnaymiz deb oʻylayapsiz?

70
00:04:40,325 --> 00:04:44,658
Men har doim qadimiy mehmonxonalarda toʻnanaman.

71
00:04:44,681 --> 00:04:48,448
Mehmonxonadagi ovqat juda mazali boʻladi.

72
00:04:48,471 --> 00:04:52,110
Mehmonxonami? Yaxshi ekan!

73
00:04:52,134 --> 00:04:58,545
Men Yaponiyaning qadimiy binolarini yaxshi koʻraman, shuning uchun qiziqaman.

74
00:04:58,568 --> 00:05:02,801
Mehmonxona yaqinida chiroyli bogʻlar ham bor.

75
00:05:02,824 --> 00:05:05,624
Albatta koʻrishni istayman.

76
00:05:05,647 --> 00:05:10,134
Kyotoning kuz faslida barglari qizil rangga kirib, juda chiroyli ekanligini aytishgan.

77
00:05:10,158 --> 00:05:13,841
Ha, juda chiroyli boʻladi.

78
00:05:13,864 --> 00:05:20,197
Lekin kuzda odamlar eng koʻp boʻladi, shuning uchun bron qilish qiyin.

79
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:22,238
Shundaymi?

80
00:05:22,262 --> 00:05:26,934
Unda, oldindan reja tuzib olish kerak, shundaymi?

81
00:05:26,958 --> 00:05:29,691
Ha, shunday qilamiz.

82
00:05:29,714 --> 00:05:34,647
Ertaga men mehmonxona haqidagi maʼlumotlarni qidirib topaman.

83
00:05:34,670 --> 00:05:36,723
Iltimos, qilib qoʻying.

84
00:05:36,747 --> 00:05:39,444
Kutib turaman.

85
00:05:39,468 --> 00:05:49,150
Eshitganlaringizni izoh qilib qoʻying.

86
00:05:49,150 --> 00:05:52,150
3-Sahna: Yangi sumkani taqdim etish

87
00:05:52,150 --> 00:05:56,883
Suzuki-san, bu sumka yangi mi?

88
00:05:56,906 --> 00:05:59,839
Bu sumkani kecha sotib oldingizmi?

89
00:05:59,862 --> 00:06:01,517
Ha.

90
00:06:01,541 --> 00:06:06,559
Bu sumkani kecha univermagdan sotib oldim.

91
00:06:06,583 --> 00:06:09,186
Juda ajoyib koʻrinadi!

92
00:06:09,209 --> 00:06:12,891
Bu sumka qancha turdi?

93
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:15,748
Bu yigirma ming yen boʻldi.

94
00:06:15,771 --> 00:06:18,771
Biroz qimmatroq edi.

95
00:06:18,794 --> 00:06:21,074
Yigirma ming yenmi?

96
00:06:21,097 --> 00:06:23,730
Biroz qimmat ekan.

97
00:06:23,753 --> 00:06:27,487
Lekin juda yengil koʻrinadi.

98
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:32,514
Ha, juda yengil va foydalanish qulay.

99
00:06:32,537 --> 00:06:36,104
Ichida juda koʻp choʻntaklar bor.

100
00:06:36,127 --> 00:06:39,538
Choʻntaklari koʻp sumka qulay boʻladi, shundaymi?

101
00:06:39,562 --> 00:06:43,095
Menga ham yangi sumka kerak.

102
00:06:43,118 --> 00:06:47,006
Tanaka-san, siz qanday sumka xohlaysiz?

103
00:06:47,029 --> 00:06:49,429
Ishga borish uchun sumkami?

104
00:06:49,452 --> 00:06:53,852
Ishda ishlatish uchun sumka xohlardim.

105
00:06:53,875 --> 00:06:57,709
Katta kompyuter sig‘adigan sumka yaxshi bo‘ladi.

106
00:06:57,732 --> 00:07:02,565
Unda, men bilan birga do‘konga boramizmi?

107
00:07:02,588 --> 00:07:06,445
U yerda sumkalar do‘koni ko‘p.

108
00:07:06,468 --> 00:07:08,435
Yaxshi fikr!

109
00:07:08,458 --> 00:07:12,025
U do‘kon qayerda joylashgan?

110
00:07:12,048 --> 00:07:15,122
Shinjuku stansiyasi yaqinida.

111
00:07:15,145 --> 00:07:18,427
Stansiyadan besh daqiqa piyoda yuriladi.

112
00:07:18,451 --> 00:07:21,818
Shinjuku bo‘lsa, ofisdan yaqin ekan.

113
00:07:21,841 --> 00:07:25,140
Shu hafta oxirida borishni rejalashtiryapman.

114
00:07:25,164 --> 00:07:32,434
Shanba kuni ertalab odamlar kam bo‘ladi, shuning uchun xarid qilish osonroq bo‘ladi.

115
00:07:32,457 --> 00:07:34,125
Tushunarli.

116
00:07:34,148 --> 00:07:37,382
Shanba kuni ertalab borishga qaror qildim.

117
00:07:37,404 --> 00:07:40,571
Yaxshi sumka topishingizni tilayman!

118
00:07:40,594 --> 00:07:42,245
Ha.

119
00:07:42,269 --> 00:07:44,669
A, Suzuki-san.

120
00:07:44,692 --> 00:07:48,730
U sumkaning yonidagi qop nima?

121
00:07:48,753 --> 00:07:53,519
Bu kecha do‘stimdan sovg‘a olgan narsam.

122
00:07:53,542 --> 00:07:56,676
Hokkaydo shirinliklari.

123
00:07:56,699 --> 00:07:59,517
Hokkaydo shirinliklarimi?

124
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:01,216
Yaxshi fikr!

125
00:08:01,239 --> 00:08:05,172
Hokkaydoda shirin taomlar ko‘p.

126
00:08:05,195 --> 00:08:08,462
Tanaka-san, siz ham bir dona tatib ko‘rasizmi?

127
00:08:08,485 --> 00:08:11,335
Juda mazali ekan!

128
00:08:11,358 --> 00:08:12,958
Rahmat.

129
00:08:12,982 --> 00:08:17,215
Unda, iliq choy bilan birga yeyman.

130
00:08:17,238 --> 00:08:20,238
4-Sahna: Ob-havo prognozi va tennis bekor qilinishi

131
00:08:20,238 --> 00:08:25,474
Suzuki-san, ertangi ob-havo prognozini ko‘rdingizmi?

132
00:08:25,497 --> 00:08:29,064
Yo‘q, hali ko‘rmadim.

133
00:08:29,088 --> 00:08:31,772
Ertaga ob-havo ochiq bo‘ladimi?

134
00:08:31,795 --> 00:08:36,995
Yo‘q, ertaga kuchli yomg‘ir yog‘adi ekan.

135
00:08:37,018 --> 00:08:39,885
Shamol ham kuchli bo‘ladi, deyishgan.

136
00:08:39,908 --> 00:08:44,113
Kuchli yomg‘irmi? Yoqmaydi.

137
00:08:44,136 --> 00:08:48,603
Ertaga tashqarida tennis o‘ynashni rejalashtirgan edim.

138
00:08:48,626 --> 00:08:50,798
Tennismi?

139
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:55,355
Ertaga tashqarida tennis o‘ynamang, xavfli bo‘ladi.

140
00:08:55,378 --> 00:08:57,395
Chunki xavfli.

141
00:08:57,418 --> 00:08:59,152
Shunday, rostdan ham.

142
00:08:59,175 --> 00:09:03,264
Unda, ertangi tennisni bekor qilamiz.

143
00:09:03,288 --> 00:09:05,454
Afsus.

144
00:09:05,477 --> 00:09:08,050
Shunday qilish yaxshiroq.

145
00:09:08,073 --> 00:09:12,326
Ertaga havo harorati ham pasayadi ekan.

146
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:14,194
Sovuq bo‘ladi.

147
00:09:14,218 --> 00:09:16,837
Sovuq bo‘ladimi?

148
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:21,158
Unda, iliq palto kiyib olsam yaxshi bo‘ladi.

149
00:09:21,182 --> 00:09:25,348
Ha, shamollamang.

150
00:09:25,371 --> 00:09:28,738
Ertaga ob-havo yomon bo‘ladi-ku.

151
00:09:28,761 --> 00:09:34,420
Tanaka-san, ertaga qayerga chiqishni rejalashtiryapsizmi?

152
00:09:34,444 --> 00:09:38,844
Yo‘q, men hech qayerga chiqmayman.

153
00:09:38,867 --> 00:09:42,233
Uyda kitob o‘qishni rejalashtiryapman.

154
00:09:42,256 --> 00:09:44,456
Yaxshi ekan.

155
00:09:44,479 --> 00:09:50,013
Men ham ertaga uyda dam olishni rejalashtirdim.

156
00:09:50,036 --> 00:09:53,902
Suzuki-san, uyda nima qilasiz?

157
00:09:53,925 --> 00:09:57,823
Men yapon tilini o‘rganaman.

158
00:09:57,847 --> 00:10:03,267
Keyingi oyda imtihon bor, shuning uchun harakat qilmoqchiman.

159
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:06,296
Imtihon bormi?

160
00:10:06,319 --> 00:10:08,594
Bu juda qiyin ekan, shunday emasmi?

161
00:10:08,617 --> 00:10:11,150
Qanday test?

162
00:10:11,173 --> 00:10:13,773
Kanji testi.

163
00:10:13,796 --> 00:10:18,094
Kanjini yodlash juda qiyin.

164
00:10:18,117 --> 00:10:22,161
Kanjini har kuni yozib turish kerak.

165
00:10:22,185 --> 00:10:25,385
Men har kuni mashq qildim.

166
00:10:25,408 --> 00:10:29,903
Ha, har kuni bir soat mashq qilaman.

167
00:10:29,926 --> 00:10:33,609
Lekin tez unutib qo‘yaman.

168
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:36,633
Bunday hamma boshida shunday bo‘ladi.

169
00:10:36,656 --> 00:10:39,463
To‘xtab qolmang, davom eting!

170
00:10:39,487 --> 00:10:41,744
Ha, rahmat.

171
00:10:41,767 --> 00:10:44,984
Ertaga kun bo‘yi harakat qilaman.

172
00:10:45,008 --> 00:10:48,008
5-SAHNA: Go‘zallik saloni bandligi va mahorati

173
00:10:48,008 --> 00:10:54,894
Suzuki-san, sizga bir narsa so‘ramoqchi edim, hozir bo‘shmisiz?

174
00:10:54,917 --> 00:10:58,084
Ha, nima deysiz?

175
00:10:58,107 --> 00:11:03,154
Hozir bo‘shman, gapiring.

176
00:11:03,178 --> 00:11:08,311
Suzuki-san, siz odatda qayerda soch oldirasiz?

177
00:11:08,334 --> 00:11:13,668
Men stansiya oldidagi go‘zallik salonida soch oldiraman.

178
00:11:13,692 --> 00:11:17,625
Ko‘k rangli reklama bor o‘sha joy.

179
00:11:17,648 --> 00:11:21,181
A, o‘sha joymi?

180
00:11:21,204 --> 00:11:24,095
U yerda yaxshi qiladilarmi?

181
00:11:24,119 --> 00:11:28,418
Ha, juda yaxshi qiladilar.

182
00:11:28,442 --> 00:11:32,058
Soch kesish mahorati ajoyib.

183
00:11:32,082 --> 00:11:35,250
Xodimlar ham juda mehribon.

184
00:11:35,273 --> 00:11:38,440
Band qilishni qanday amalga oshirasiz?

185
00:11:38,463 --> 00:11:40,296
Telefon orqali?

186
00:11:40,319 --> 00:11:44,453
Internet orqali band qilish mumkin.

187
00:11:44,476 --> 00:11:47,342
Telefon orqali band qilishdan osonroq.

188
00:11:47,365 --> 00:11:49,377
Shundaymi?

189
00:11:49,401 --> 00:11:53,419
Men ham kelgusi hafta sochimni oldirmoqchiman.

190
00:11:53,442 --> 00:11:57,209
Hozir sochim juda uzun bo‘lib qoldi.

191
00:11:57,233 --> 00:12:00,766
Rostdan ham biroz uzunroq ekan.

192
00:12:00,789 --> 00:12:05,556
Qisqaroq soch sizga ko‘proq mos keladi, deb o‘ylayman.

193
00:12:05,579 --> 00:12:07,612
Rahmat.

194
00:12:07,635 --> 00:12:12,002
O‘sha joyda qancha turadi?

195
00:12:12,025 --> 00:12:15,802
Soch kesish uchun to‘rt ming yen atrofida.

196
00:12:15,825 --> 00:12:19,510
Boshqa joylarga nisbatan arzonroq.

197
00:12:19,534 --> 00:12:23,767
To‘rt ming yenmi? Yaxshi ekan.

198
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:29,157
Qimmat emas, shuning uchun band qilib boraman.

199
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:35,018
Shanba kunlari gavjum bo‘ladi, ish kunlarining kechasi yaxshiroq.

200
00:12:35,041 --> 00:12:37,844
Kechasi soat to‘qqizgacha ochiq.

201
00:12:37,867 --> 00:12:42,364
Kechasi soat to‘qqizgacha ochiqmi? Bu juda qulay ekan.

202
00:12:42,388 --> 00:12:45,521
Ishdan keyin band qilaman.

203
00:12:45,544 --> 00:12:48,744
Ha, shunday qiling.

204
00:12:48,767 --> 00:12:52,574
Shunda dam olishingiz mumkin.

205
00:12:52,598 --> 00:12:57,577
Suzuki-san, navbatdagi safar qachon borasiz?

206
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:03,445
Men keyingi oy oxirida perma qilmoqchiman.

207
00:13:03,468 --> 00:13:06,435
Perma qilmoqchimisiz? Yaxshi ekan.

208
00:13:06,458 --> 00:13:09,791
Albatta, juda chiroyli bo‘lasiz.

209
00:13:09,814 --> 00:13:11,948
Ha, rahmat.

210
00:13:11,971 --> 00:13:14,771
Kutib turaman.

211
00:13:14,794 --> 00:13:17,794
6-SAHNA: Xarid qilish va yangi kamera

212
00:13:17,794 --> 00:13:23,560
Suzuki-san, kecha biror joyda xarid qildingizmi?

213
00:13:23,583 --> 00:13:25,983
Stansiyada ko‘rib qoldim sizni.

214
00:13:26,006 --> 00:13:32,006
Ha, kecha Shibuya shahridagi katta elektronika do'koniga bordim.

215
00:13:32,029 --> 00:13:34,429
Nima sotib oldingiz?

216
00:13:34,452 --> 00:13:37,427
Yangi maishiy texnika sotib oldingizmi?

217
00:13:37,451 --> 00:13:40,726
Yangi kamera sotib oldim.

218
00:13:40,749 --> 00:13:42,983
Bu mana.

219
00:13:43,006 --> 00:13:46,103
Kecha bozorga chiqqan yangi mahsulot.

220
00:13:46,126 --> 00:13:50,203
Vov, juda zo'r kamera ekan!

221
00:13:50,227 --> 00:13:52,460
Qimmat bo'lgani shubhasiz, shundaymi?

222
00:13:52,483 --> 00:13:55,970
Ha, ellik ming yen edi.

223
00:13:55,994 --> 00:14:00,127
Menga biroz qimmatroq tushdi.

224
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:02,487
Ellik ming yenmi?

225
00:14:02,511 --> 00:14:10,244
Lekin Suzuki-san, siz suratga olishni yaxshi bilasiz, shuning uchun yaxshi kamera kerak.

226
00:14:10,267 --> 00:14:14,308
Yo'q, hali ham yaxshimasman.

227
00:14:14,332 --> 00:14:17,532
Ko'proq mashq qilishni xohlayman.

228
00:14:17,555 --> 00:14:21,688
Bu kamerada qanday suratga olishni rejalashtirmoqdasiz?

229
00:14:21,711 --> 00:14:28,244
Yaponiyaning go'zal manzaralari va mazali taomlarining suratlarini olishni xohlayman.

230
00:14:28,267 --> 00:14:29,801
Yaxshi fikr!

231
00:14:29,824 --> 00:14:34,990
Keyin men pishirgan taomlaringizning suratlarini ham oling.

232
00:14:35,013 --> 00:14:38,747
Ha, albatta suratga olishni xohlayman.

233
00:14:38,770 --> 00:14:43,053
Tanaka-sanning taomlari har doim mazali ko'rinadi.

234
00:14:43,076 --> 00:14:45,276
Rahmat.

235
00:14:45,299 --> 00:14:47,387
Xursand bo'ldim.

236
00:14:47,410 --> 00:14:50,977
Yaxshi deganlar menga ishonch bag'ishlaydi.

237
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:54,495
Tanaka-san, sizda kamera bormi?

238
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:58,355
Yo'q, men da kamera yo'q.

239
00:14:58,378 --> 00:15:01,995
Har doim smartfon kamerasi bilan suratga olaman.

240
00:15:02,018 --> 00:15:08,913
Yaqinda smartfonlar juda yaxshi suratga oladi, shuning uchun smartfon bilan ham yetarli.

241
00:15:08,937 --> 00:15:15,903
Ha, lekin Suzuki-sanning yangi kamerasini ko'rgandan keyin men ham xohlab qoldim.

242
00:15:15,926 --> 00:15:20,260
Unda keyingi safar birga elektronika do'koniga boring.

243
00:15:20,283 --> 00:15:23,249
Ko'p xil kameralar bor.

244
00:15:23,272 --> 00:15:24,963
Yaxshi fikr!

245
00:15:24,987 --> 00:15:27,987
Faqat ko'rish ham qiziqarli bo'lishi mumkin.

246
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:34,210
Ha, dam olish kunlarida tadbirlar ham bo'ladi, shuning uchun yanada qiziqarli bo'ladi.

247
00:15:34,233 --> 00:15:36,566
Ha, boramiz.

248
00:15:36,589 --> 00:15:39,589
7-Sahna: Qo'shimcha ish va dam olish rejalari / Qayta ishlash va dam olishni rejalashtirish

249
00:15:39,589 --> 00:15:43,795
Suzuki-san, yaqinda bandmisiz?

250
00:15:43,819 --> 00:15:47,586
Yuz rangingiz biroz yaxshi emas.

251
00:15:47,609 --> 00:15:54,375
Ha, bu hafta ko'p ish bor, shuning uchun biroz qiyin.

252
00:15:54,398 --> 00:15:58,432
Har kuni soat nechagacha ishlaysiz?

253
00:15:58,455 --> 00:16:02,899
Har kuni kechki soat sakkizgacha ishlayman.

254
00:16:02,922 --> 00:16:05,855
Kecha ham sakkizgacha ishladim.

255
00:16:05,878 --> 00:16:08,932
Bu juda charchaydi.

256
00:16:08,955 --> 00:16:15,632
Har kuni qo'shimcha ishlash yaxshi emas, ortiqcha zo'rmang.

257
00:16:15,656 --> 00:16:17,456
Rahmat.

258
00:16:17,479 --> 00:16:23,212
Lekin, kelgusi haftadan loyiha tugaydi, shuning uchun bo'sh vaqtim bo'ladi deb o'ylayman.

259
00:16:23,235 --> 00:16:26,469
Shundaymi, yaxshi yangilik.

260
00:16:26,492 --> 00:16:30,225
Bo'sh vaqt paytida nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

261
00:16:30,248 --> 00:16:34,067
Do'stlarim bilan dengizga borishni rejalashtiryapman.

262
00:16:34,091 --> 00:16:39,372
Dengizda suzish va mazali baliqlar yeyishni xohlayman.

263
00:16:39,396 --> 00:16:42,642
Dengizmi? Juda yaxshi.

264
00:16:42,665 --> 00:16:45,914
Qayerdagi dengizga borasiz?

265
00:16:45,938 --> 00:16:49,904
Kanagava prefekturasidagi dengizga boraman.

266
00:16:49,927 --> 00:16:54,201
Tokiodan poyezdda taxminan bir soatda borish mumkin.

267
00:16:54,225 --> 00:16:58,032
Bir soatmi? Yaqin ekan!

268
00:16:58,056 --> 00:17:01,262
Men ham dengizni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

269
00:17:01,286 --> 00:17:04,154
Qumli plyaj juda chiroyli, shuning uchun.

270
00:17:04,177 --> 00:17:07,449
Tanaka-san, birga bormaymizmi?

271
00:17:07,472 --> 00:17:10,513
Doʻstlar ham xursand boʻlishadi.

272
00:17:10,537 --> 00:17:12,829
Rostdan ham boʻlsa?

273
00:17:12,853 --> 00:17:15,786
Albatta, birga bormoqchiman!

274
00:17:15,809 --> 00:17:18,548
Dengiz juda qiziqarli, shuning uchun.

275
00:17:18,572 --> 00:17:23,669
Xoʻsh, kelgusi shanba kuni boramiz.

276
00:17:23,693 --> 00:17:28,329
Mashinada borish qulayroq, shuning uchun ijaraga mashina olamiz.

277
00:17:28,353 --> 00:17:30,319
Tushunarli.

278
00:17:30,342 --> 00:17:34,675
Ijaraga olingan mashina uchun pulni men toʻlayman.

279
00:17:34,698 --> 00:17:38,133
Yoʻq, hammamiz boʻlib toʻlaymiz.

280
00:17:38,157 --> 00:17:41,566
Adolatliroq boʻladi, yaxshi.

281
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:43,590
Shundaymi?

282
00:17:43,613 --> 00:17:48,792
Xoʻsh, oʻsha kuni nonushta uchun men ovqat tayyorlab olib kelaman.

283
00:17:48,815 --> 00:17:51,581
Bento (ovqat qutisi).

284
00:17:51,604 --> 00:17:54,302
Vaa, katta rahmat!

285
00:17:54,326 --> 00:17:59,774
Tanaka-sanning uyda tayyorlagan ovqati juda mazali, shuning uchun intizorlik bilan kutaman.

286
00:17:59,797 --> 00:18:02,830
Ha, ishonib topshiring.

287
00:18:02,853 --> 00:18:04,987
Koʻp tayyorlayman.

288
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:08,543
Ha, albatta, ob-havo ochiq boʻladi.

289
00:18:08,566 --> 00:18:11,566
Sahna 8: Ziyofat tayyorlash va xarid qilish

290
00:18:11,566 --> 00:18:17,499
Fuzuki-san, ertangi ziyofat uchun tayyorgarlik tugadimi?

291
00:18:17,522 --> 00:18:21,166
Yoʻq, hali tugamadi.

292
00:18:21,190 --> 00:18:25,797
Yuk koʻp, shuning uchun hozir xaridga chiqmoqchiman.

293
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:28,153
Nima xarid qilmoqchisiz?

294
00:18:28,176 --> 00:18:29,980
Supermarketga borasizmi?

295
00:18:30,004 --> 00:18:34,206
Koʻp ichimlik va shirinliklar xarid qilmoqchiman.

296
00:18:34,230 --> 00:18:36,663
Koʻp kerak boʻladi, shuning uchun.

297
00:18:36,686 --> 00:18:42,023
Yuk ogʻir boʻladi, shuning uchun men ham birga boraman.

298
00:18:42,046 --> 00:18:44,114
Mashinani men haydayman.

299
00:18:44,137 --> 00:18:45,775
Rahmat.

300
00:18:45,799 --> 00:18:47,698
Yordam berasiz, katta rahmat.

301
00:18:47,721 --> 00:18:50,521
Yolgʻiz boʻlsam, qiyin boʻlardi.

302
00:18:50,544 --> 00:18:53,950
Ziyofatga necha kishi keladi?

303
00:18:53,973 --> 00:18:57,573
Jami yigirmaga yaqin kishi kelishi kerak.

304
00:18:57,596 --> 00:19:00,263
Juda gavjum boʻladi.

305
00:19:00,286 --> 00:19:05,086
Yigirmakishi? Katta ziyofat boʻladi-ku!

306
00:19:05,109 --> 00:19:07,312
Xona qayerda?

307
00:19:07,335 --> 00:19:10,618
Kompaniyaga yaqin ijaraga olingan xonada.

308
00:19:10,642 --> 00:19:13,609
U yer keng va chiroyli.

309
00:19:13,632 --> 00:19:16,001
A, u yerda-ku!

310
00:19:16,025 --> 00:19:20,858
Albatta, yangi bino, yaxshi joy.

311
00:19:20,881 --> 00:19:26,448
Ha, lekin chiqindilarni hammasini olib ketish kerak.

312
00:19:26,471 --> 00:19:28,604
Bu yerda qoidalar qattiq.

313
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:32,960
Shundaymi, bu biroz qiyin boʻladi-ku.

314
00:19:32,983 --> 00:19:36,950
Katta chiqindi paketlari koʻp kerak boʻladi.

315
00:19:36,973 --> 00:19:42,706
Ha, uni ham bugun elektr doʻkoni yonidagi supermarketdan xarid qilaman.

316
00:19:42,729 --> 00:19:46,008
Ziyofat nechada boshlanadi?

317
00:19:46,032 --> 00:19:48,904
Kechki yetti daqiqadan boshlanadi.

318
00:19:48,927 --> 00:19:50,861
To toʻqqizgacha davom etadi.

319
00:19:50,884 --> 00:19:52,617
Ikki soat davom etadi.

320
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:55,044
Tushunarli.

321
00:19:55,067 --> 00:19:59,701
Suzuki-san, ertaga nechada joyga borasiz?

322
00:19:59,724 --> 00:20:03,900
Men beshda boraman, chunki tayyorgarlik bor.

323
00:20:03,923 --> 00:20:08,381
Unda men ham beshda borib, tayyorgarlikda yordam beraman.

324
00:20:08,404 --> 00:20:10,337
Rahmat.

325
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:13,894
Tanaka-san, siz juda mehribon ekansiz.

326
00:20:13,916 --> 00:20:16,207
Har doim yordam berasiz.

327
00:20:16,231 --> 00:20:21,877
Yoʻq, men partiyalarga juda qiziqaman, shunchaki zavqlanmoqchiman.

328
00:20:21,901 --> 00:20:24,572
Haha, shundaymi?

329
00:20:24,595 --> 00:20:28,676
Endi birgalikda ajoyib partiya qilamiz.

330
00:20:28,700 --> 00:20:31,700
Sahna 9: Yapon tilini yaxshilashning sirlari / Yapon tilini yaxshilash uchun maslahatlar

331
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:36,597
Suzuki-san, Yaponiyadagi hayotingiz qanday?

332
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:42,105
Endi bir yil boʻldi, anchagina oʻrganib qoldim.

333
00:20:42,128 --> 00:20:45,395
Hayot juda qulay.

334
00:20:45,418 --> 00:20:49,651
Yapon tilingiz ham anchagina yaxshilandi.

335
00:20:49,674 --> 00:20:52,282
Talaffuzingiz juda chiroyli.

336
00:20:52,305 --> 00:20:56,105
Yoʻq, hali ham yaxshi emas.

337
00:20:56,128 --> 00:21:00,162
Yangiliklardagi yapon tilini umuman tushunmayman.

338
00:21:00,185 --> 00:21:05,751
Yangiliklardagi yapon tili qiyin soʻzlar koʻp boʻladi.

339
00:21:05,774 --> 00:21:10,646
Har kuni televizor koʻrsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

340
00:21:10,670 --> 00:21:13,303
Ha, har kuni koʻryapman.

341
00:21:13,326 --> 00:21:19,060
Lekin, diktorlar juda tez gapiradilar.

342
00:21:19,083 --> 00:21:20,816
Shunday, rostdan ham.

343
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:26,972
Unda, avval bolalar uchun moʻljallangan oddiy multfilmlarni koʻrsangiz yaxshi boʻladi.

344
00:21:26,995 --> 00:21:29,806
Bolalar uchun multfilmlar deysizmi?

345
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:32,722
Bu yaxshi fikr ekan.

346
00:21:32,745 --> 00:21:35,618
Soʻzlari oddiy boʻladi.

347
00:21:35,642 --> 00:21:44,479
Ha, yapon bolalari multfilmlar orqali soʻzlarni oʻrganadilar, shuning uchun samarali.

348
00:21:44,502 --> 00:21:45,937
Tushunarli.

349
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:49,327
Bugundan boshlab darhol koʻrishni boshlayman.

350
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:54,317
Yaponiyadagi hayotingizda eng qiyin narsa nima?

351
00:21:54,341 --> 00:21:56,560
Narxlarmi?

352
00:21:56,583 --> 00:22:02,230
Yoʻq, har ertalab poyezdlar doimo gavjum boʻladi.

353
00:22:02,254 --> 00:22:06,587
Ertalabki gavjum poyezdlar juda qiyin.

354
00:22:06,610 --> 00:22:10,864
A, gavjum poyezdlar desangiz.

355
00:22:10,888 --> 00:22:15,534
Yaponlar hammasi undan nafratlanadilar.

356
00:22:15,558 --> 00:22:18,158
Tor va noqulay boʻladi.

357
00:22:18,181 --> 00:22:23,275
Tanaka-san, siz ham har ertalab shu gavjum poyezdda sayohat qilasizmi?

358
00:22:23,299 --> 00:22:30,499
Yoʻq, men poyezdlarni yoqtirmayman, shuning uchun har doim velosipedda ishga boraman.

359
00:22:30,523 --> 00:22:32,726
Bu sogʻlom turmush tarzi.

360
00:22:32,749 --> 00:22:34,986
Velosipedmi?

361
00:22:35,010 --> 00:22:37,987
Yomgʻirli kunlarda nima qilasiz?

362
00:22:38,011 --> 00:22:39,944
Qiyin boʻladi, shundaymi?

363
00:22:39,967 --> 00:22:43,367
Yomgʻirli kunlarda avtobusda boraman.

364
00:22:43,390 --> 00:22:48,447
Avtobuslar poyezddan boʻshroq boʻladi, shuning uchun tinch.

365
00:22:48,470 --> 00:22:50,237
Shundaymi?

366
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:54,098
Poyezdning stressi kamroq ekanligi yaxshi.

367
00:22:54,122 --> 00:22:58,170
Men ham ertaga avtobusda borishga qaror qildim.

368
00:22:58,193 --> 00:23:01,659
Ha, bir marta sinab koʻring.

369
00:23:01,682 --> 00:23:05,492
Poyezddan ancha qulayroq boʻladi, deb oʻylayman.

370
00:23:05,516 --> 00:23:07,449
Tushunarli.

371
00:23:07,472 --> 00:23:11,210
Koʻp narsalarni oʻrgatib yuborganingiz uchun rahmat.

372
00:23:11,234 --> 00:23:14,234
Sahna 10: Yangi kafe topish / Yangi kafe kashf etish

373
00:23:14,234 --> 00:23:20,100
Suzuki-san, kecha stansiya yaqinidagi yangi kafe bor edingizmi?

374
00:23:20,123 --> 00:23:22,923
Ha, bor edim.

375
00:23:22,946 --> 00:23:26,029
Uchlar atrofida kofe ichardim.

376
00:23:26,052 --> 00:23:28,419
Qanday qilib bilib qoldingiz?

377
00:23:28,442 --> 00:23:31,413
Shunday ekan, Suzuki-san edi, shundaymi?

378
00:23:31,436 --> 00:23:34,207
Ovoz berib yuborsam edi.

379
00:23:34,231 --> 00:23:37,831
A, Tanaka-san ham oʻsha kafeda edingizmi?

380
00:23:37,854 --> 00:23:42,220
Yoʻq, men mashinada oldidan oʻtdim.

381
00:23:42,243 --> 00:23:46,010
Derazaga yaqin joyda Suzuki-sanni koʻrib qoldim.

382
00:23:46,033 --> 00:23:48,400
Shunday ekan.

383
00:23:48,423 --> 00:23:53,681
Oʻsha kafe juda tinch, shuning uchun men oʻqish paytida tez-tez boraman.

384
00:23:53,704 --> 00:23:56,974
Oʻsha kafening qahvasi mazali boʻladi-ku?

385
00:23:56,997 --> 00:24:00,531
Ha, juda mazali.

386
00:24:00,554 --> 00:24:03,087
Hidi ham juda yaxshi.

387
00:24:03,110 --> 00:24:06,317
Choy ham koʻp turda bor.

388
00:24:06,341 --> 00:24:07,987
Yaxshi fikr!

389
00:24:08,010 --> 00:24:12,882
Kafe juda zamonaviy, shuning uchun keyingi safar men ham borib koʻrmoqchiman.

390
00:24:12,906 --> 00:24:17,239
Unda, bugungi ishdan keyin birga boramizmi?

391
00:24:17,262 --> 00:24:19,146
Bugunmi?

392
00:24:19,169 --> 00:24:26,336
Bugun soat beshda ish tugaydi, borishim mumkin. Menda ham beshda tugaydi.

393
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:30,092
Bu hafta ishlar uncha band emas.

394
00:24:30,115 --> 00:24:32,574
Unda, birga boramiz.

395
00:24:32,598 --> 00:24:36,271
Oʻsha kafeda shirin tortlar ham bormi?

396
00:24:36,294 --> 00:24:40,861
Ha, shokoladli tort va rulet tort bor.

397
00:24:40,884 --> 00:24:43,550
Juda shirin va mazali.

398
00:24:43,573 --> 00:24:47,973
Vaa, men shokoladli tortni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

399
00:24:47,996 --> 00:24:50,689
Shirin narsalarni eng yaxshi koʻraman.

400
00:24:50,712 --> 00:24:55,567
U yerda shokoladli tort eng mashhur.

401
00:24:55,591 --> 00:24:58,958
Mashhur boʻlgani uchun tezda tugab qoladi.

402
00:24:58,981 --> 00:25:00,395
Shundaymi?

403
00:25:00,418 --> 00:25:04,673
Tugab qolishini istamaymiz, shuning uchun tezroq boring.

404
00:25:04,697 --> 00:25:10,133
Ha, besh yarimda kafega yetib olishimiz mumkin, muammo yoʻq.

405
00:25:10,156 --> 00:25:11,994
Kutishga arziydi.

406
00:25:12,017 --> 00:25:15,952
Bugungi ishni tezroq tugatishga harakat qilaman.

407
00:25:15,976 --> 00:25:19,066
Ha, men ham harakat qilaman.

408
00:25:19,090 --> 00:25:22,090
11-SAHNA: Xarid qilish rejalari

409
00:25:22,090 --> 00:25:27,904
Ob-havo yaxshi ekan, qayerga boramizmi?

410
00:25:27,928 --> 00:25:31,405
Menga yangi sumka kerak.

411
00:25:31,429 --> 00:25:33,995
Qayerga xarid qilishga boramiz?

412
00:25:34,018 --> 00:25:38,088
Stansiya oldidagi univermagga boramiz.

413
00:25:38,112 --> 00:25:41,112
Qanday sumka kerak?

414
00:25:41,135 --> 00:25:45,611
Menga katta sumka kerak.

415
00:25:45,635 --> 00:25:49,612
Yangi sumkangizga nima solasiz?

416
00:25:49,635 --> 00:25:54,002
Lugʻat va darsliklarni koʻp solaman.

417
00:25:54,025 --> 00:25:56,392
Ogʻir yuk ekan-ku.

418
00:25:56,415 --> 00:26:02,948
Shuning uchun mustahkam sumka kerak. Qanday rang kerak?

419
00:26:02,971 --> 00:26:07,045
Menga qora rang yoqadi.

420
00:26:07,068 --> 00:26:10,468
Qora sumka juda zoʻr boʻladi.

421
00:26:10,491 --> 00:26:14,558
Har kuni maktabga olib borishni xohlayman.

422
00:26:14,581 --> 00:26:18,548
Univermagda poyabzal doʻkoni ham bor.

423
00:26:18,571 --> 00:26:21,908
Menga poyabzal ham kerak.

424
00:26:21,932 --> 00:26:24,581
Qanday poyabzal kerak?

425
00:26:24,605 --> 00:26:28,689
Menga yengil poyabzal kerak.

426
00:26:28,712 --> 00:26:31,330
Sayr qilish uchun yaxshi boʻladi.

427
00:26:31,354 --> 00:26:35,321
Har kuni koʻp yurishni xohlayman.

428
00:26:35,344 --> 00:26:40,782
Unda, bugun univermagga poyabzal ham koʻrishga boramiz.

429
00:26:40,805 --> 00:26:44,649
Bugungi xarid qilish juda qiziqarli bo'lishi kerak.

430
00:26:44,673 --> 00:26:49,406
Men do'konda shirinliklar sotib olmoqchiman.

431
00:26:49,429 --> 00:26:52,908
Xarid qilgandan keyin birga yeyishni unutmang.

432
00:26:52,931 --> 00:26:55,665
Tezroq stansiyaga boring.

433
00:26:55,688 --> 00:26:58,688
12-Sahna: Bazm tayyorlash va tozalash / Bazmga tayyorgarlik va tozalash

434
00:26:58,688 --> 00:27:02,578
Ertangi bazm uchun tayyorgarlik ko'ryapman.

435
00:27:02,601 --> 00:27:06,606
Hozir xonani tozalayapman.

436
00:27:06,630 --> 00:27:08,278
Rahmat.

437
00:27:08,301 --> 00:27:11,434
Tozalash tugadi-ku!

438
00:27:11,457 --> 00:27:14,691
Keyin nima qilamiz?

439
00:27:14,714 --> 00:27:18,853
Stol ustiga taomlarni joylashtiring.

440
00:27:18,876 --> 00:27:21,757
Bu yerga joylashtirsam bo'ladimi?

441
00:27:21,781 --> 00:27:23,423
Iltimos.

442
00:27:23,446 --> 00:27:26,823
Ichimliklar qayerda?

443
00:27:26,847 --> 00:27:29,780
Muzlatgichda bor.

444
00:27:29,803 --> 00:27:32,644
Kimlar bazmga keladi?

445
00:27:32,667 --> 00:27:36,671
Sinfdoshlarimdan o'n nafari keladi.

446
00:27:36,695 --> 00:27:39,183
Juda gavjum bo'ladi-ku!

447
00:27:39,206 --> 00:27:42,944
Shuning uchun derazalarni ochiq qoldiring.

448
00:27:42,968 --> 00:27:45,866
Musiqa qo'yishim mumkinmi?

449
00:27:45,890 --> 00:27:49,657
Musiqa eshitib tayyorgarlik ko'raylik.

450
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:53,913
Menda yangi CD bor.

451
00:27:53,936 --> 00:27:56,582
Uni qo'ying.

452
00:27:56,606 --> 00:27:59,101
Stullar yetmayapti-ku!

453
00:27:59,125 --> 00:28:02,691
Yon xonadan olib kelaymi?

454
00:28:02,714 --> 00:28:05,133
Beshta olib keling.

455
00:28:05,157 --> 00:28:09,690
Ko'p ovqat tayyorlayapman, yordam bering.

456
00:28:09,713 --> 00:28:13,580
Men hozir olib kelayapman.

457
00:28:13,603 --> 00:28:16,214
Idishlarni ham joylashtirib qo'ying.

458
00:28:16,237 --> 00:28:18,604
Qayerda u?

459
00:28:18,627 --> 00:28:22,194
Javonda turibdi, olib chiqing.

460
00:28:22,217 --> 00:28:24,819
Hozir olib chiqayapman.

461
00:28:24,842 --> 00:28:27,780
Stakanlarni ham yuvib qo'ying.

462
00:28:27,803 --> 00:28:31,022
Stakanlar allaqachon yuvib qo'yilgan-ku!

463
00:28:31,046 --> 00:28:33,459
Rahmat.

464
00:28:33,482 --> 00:28:36,482
13-Sahna: Yarim kunlik ish va yapon tili / Yarim kunlik ish va yapon tili mashqi

465
00:28:36,482 --> 00:28:40,215
Yangi yarim kunlik ish qanday?

466
00:28:40,238 --> 00:28:44,238
Har kuni juda qiziqarli.

467
00:28:44,261 --> 00:28:47,355
Qanday ish qilasiz?

468
00:28:47,379 --> 00:28:51,512
Restoranda ovqatlarni olib yuraman.

469
00:28:51,535 --> 00:28:55,205
Har kuni soat nechada borasiz?

470
00:28:55,228 --> 00:28:59,028
Ertalab soat o'nda boraman.

471
00:28:59,051 --> 00:29:05,289
Do'konga kelib, qo'llaringizni yuvib, keyin kiyimlarni almashtirasiz.

472
00:29:05,312 --> 00:29:07,797
Qoidalar qattiqmi?

473
00:29:07,821 --> 00:29:12,621
Ish paytida telefon ishlatish mumkin emas.

474
00:29:12,644 --> 00:29:15,500
Har doim turib turasizmi?

475
00:29:15,524 --> 00:29:19,990
Mijozlar oldida o'tirish mumkin emas.

476
00:29:20,013 --> 00:29:22,346
Qiyin ekan-ku!

477
00:29:22,369 --> 00:29:28,736
Lekin har kuni yapon tilida gaplashaman, shuning uchun tilim yaxshilanadi.

478
00:29:28,759 --> 00:29:31,292
Yaxshi odat ekan.

479
00:29:31,315 --> 00:29:36,715
Men har kuni uch soat shu yerda ishlayman.

480
00:29:36,738 --> 00:29:40,548
Ovqat tayyorlash ishini ham qilasizmi?

481
00:29:40,572 --> 00:29:44,623
Taom pishirishga ruxsat yo'q.

482
00:29:44,647 --> 00:29:46,826
Faqat olib yurasizmi?

483
00:29:46,850 --> 00:29:51,519
Taomni olib kelib, keyin idishlarni yuvaman.

484
00:29:51,542 --> 00:29:53,879
Bandmisiz?

485
00:29:53,903 --> 00:29:58,436
Tushlik vaqtida juda band bo'laman.

486
00:29:58,459 --> 00:30:01,626
Kiyimlarni o'zingiz yuvasizmi?

487
00:30:01,649 --> 00:30:04,482
Kompaniyada yuvamiz.

488
00:30:04,505 --> 00:30:06,838
Yaxshi do'kon ekan!

489
00:30:06,861 --> 00:30:12,234
Men bu do'konda uzoq vaqtdan beri ishlayapman.

490
00:30:12,258 --> 00:30:15,258
14-Sahna: Sayohat jadvalini tushuntirish

491
00:30:15,258 --> 00:30:18,991
Sayohat jadvalini tushuntirib beraman.

492
00:30:19,014 --> 00:30:20,581
Iltimos.

493
00:30:20,604 --> 00:30:25,379
Ertalab soat sakkizda mehmonxonadan chiqib, stansiyagacha piyoda boramiz.

494
00:30:25,402 --> 00:30:29,075
Stansiyaga borgach, nima qilamiz?

495
00:30:29,099 --> 00:30:34,366
Stansiyaga borgach, chipta sotib olib, poyezdda ketamiz.

496
00:30:34,390 --> 00:30:38,157
Poyezdda ovqatlanamizmi?

497
00:30:38,180 --> 00:30:42,113
Ibodatxonaga yetib borgach, ovqatlanamiz.

498
00:30:42,136 --> 00:30:44,303
Qanday ibodatxona?

499
00:30:44,326 --> 00:30:49,263
O'sha ibodatxonaning bog'i keng va go'zal joy.

500
00:30:49,287 --> 00:30:51,495
Kutishga arziydi.

501
00:30:51,518 --> 00:30:57,012
Mashhur bino darvozasi katta va hashamatli.

502
00:30:57,035 --> 00:30:59,835
Ko'p suratga tushmoqchiman.

503
00:30:59,858 --> 00:31:04,058
Ibodatxonani ko'rib chiqib, yaqin atrofdagi dengizga boramiz.

504
00:31:04,081 --> 00:31:07,419
Dengizga borgach, nima qilamiz?

505
00:31:07,443 --> 00:31:13,114
Dengiz bo'yida sayr qilib, keyin mazali baliq yeymiz.

506
00:31:13,138 --> 00:31:17,350
O'sha shaharning baliqlari yangi va mazali ekan-ku!

507
00:31:17,373 --> 00:31:22,339
Baliq yeb, keyin sovg'alar sotib olamiz.

508
00:31:22,362 --> 00:31:27,211
Sovg'alarni sotib olib, keyin mehmonxonaga qaytamizmi?

509
00:31:27,235 --> 00:31:30,689
Kechqurun soat yettida mehmonxonaga qaytamiz.

510
00:31:30,713 --> 00:31:33,403
Band jadval ekan-ku!

511
00:31:33,426 --> 00:31:38,992
Lekin o'sha shahar manzarasi go'zal va qiziqarli joy.

512
00:31:39,015 --> 00:31:42,470
Ertaga ko'p suratga tushamiz.

513
00:31:42,494 --> 00:31:47,832
Bugun erta uxlab, ertaga ko'p yuramiz.

514
00:31:47,855 --> 00:31:50,422
Bugun erta uxlayman.

515
00:31:50,445 --> 00:31:53,445
15-Sahna: Kasal bo'lganingizda nima qilish kerak

516
00:31:53,445 --> 00:31:55,902
Nima bo'ldi?

517
00:31:55,926 --> 00:32:00,726
Boshim biroz og'riyapti va isitma bor.

518
00:32:00,749 --> 00:32:04,041
Tana og'ir tuyulib, qiyin ekan.

519
00:32:04,064 --> 00:32:06,630
Juda og'riyapti.

520
00:32:06,653 --> 00:32:09,269
Shifoxonaga bordingizmi?

521
00:32:09,293 --> 00:32:11,940
Hali bormadim.

522
00:32:11,963 --> 00:32:15,702
Yaqin joyda yaxshi shifoxona bor.

523
00:32:15,726 --> 00:32:19,341
U yerda shifokorlar mehribonmi?

524
00:32:19,365 --> 00:32:22,098
Shifoxonaga boring.

525
00:32:22,121 --> 00:32:24,008
Tushunarli.

526
00:32:24,032 --> 00:32:27,720
Bugun vanna qabul qilmang.

527
00:32:27,743 --> 00:32:30,877
Dush ham olmang.

528
00:32:30,900 --> 00:32:34,678
Bugun erta uxlashingiz kerak.

529
00:32:34,701 --> 00:32:37,556
Nima ovqat yeyish kerak?

530
00:32:37,580 --> 00:32:40,716
Yumshoq udon tayyorlayman.

531
00:32:40,739 --> 00:32:42,506
Iltimos.

532
00:32:42,529 --> 00:32:47,103
Men hozir xarid qilishga ketishim kerak.

533
00:32:47,126 --> 00:32:50,816
Unda men xonada kutaman.

534
00:32:50,839 --> 00:32:53,909
Dori ichib, keyin uxlang.

535
00:32:53,932 --> 00:32:55,511
Rahmat.

536
00:32:55,535 --> 00:32:59,668
Bugun uy vazifani topshirishim kerakmi?

537
00:32:59,691 --> 00:33:02,658
Bugun topshirmasangiz ham boʻladi.

538
00:33:02,681 --> 00:33:06,490
Ertaga maktabga olib borganingiz kerak.

539
00:33:06,514 --> 00:33:08,847
Tushunarli.

540
00:33:08,870 --> 00:33:13,003
Kalitni yoping va hech kimni kirgizmang.

541
00:33:13,026 --> 00:33:14,467
Yopaman.

542
00:33:14,491 --> 00:33:17,491
16-SAHNA: Dam olish kunini qanday oʻtkazish / Dam olish kunini oʻtkazish

543
00:33:17,491 --> 00:33:20,785
Ertaga dam olish kunimiz, shundaymi?

544
00:33:20,809 --> 00:33:24,409
Ertaga ishga bormasangiz ham boʻladi.

545
00:33:24,432 --> 00:33:26,832
Juda yaxshi!

546
00:33:26,855 --> 00:33:31,222
Shuning uchun bugun kechgacha uxlamayman.

547
00:33:31,245 --> 00:33:34,245
Ertaga nima qilmoqchisiz?

548
00:33:34,268 --> 00:33:37,868
Men suratga tushishga boraman.

549
00:33:37,891 --> 00:33:40,224
Suratga olishmi?

550
00:33:40,247 --> 00:33:45,936
Mening sevimli mashgʻulotim – eski binolarni suratga olish.

551
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:48,160
Ajoyib!

552
00:33:48,183 --> 00:33:51,316
Sizning qiziqishingiz nima?

553
00:33:51,339 --> 00:33:56,037
Men suzishni yaxshi koʻraman.

554
00:33:56,061 --> 00:33:58,095
Basseynga borasizmi?

555
00:33:58,118 --> 00:34:01,085
Har kuni ikki soat suzaman.

556
00:34:01,108 --> 00:34:03,351
Ajoyib!

557
00:34:03,374 --> 00:34:07,553
Men umuman suza olmayman.

558
00:34:07,577 --> 00:34:11,667
Qiziqarli, shuning uchun keyingi safar oʻrgataman.

559
00:34:11,690 --> 00:34:13,357
Iltimos.

560
00:34:13,380 --> 00:34:17,834
Sportdan oldin odatda nima qilasiz?

561
00:34:17,858 --> 00:34:22,824
Men yugurishdan oldin koʻp suv ichaman.

562
00:34:22,847 --> 00:34:25,114
Bu juda muhim.

563
00:34:25,137 --> 00:34:31,871
Men suzishdan oldin har doim biroz raqsga tushaman.

564
00:34:31,894 --> 00:34:33,863
Raqsmi?

565
00:34:33,886 --> 00:34:36,257
Qiziqarli!

566
00:34:36,281 --> 00:34:40,556
Tana isiydi, shuning uchun yaxshi.

567
00:34:40,579 --> 00:34:44,779
Chiqishdan oldin kamerani tayyorlayman.

568
00:34:44,802 --> 00:34:50,136
Ertaga erta turmasangiz ham boʻladi, shuning uchun koʻp uxlang.

569
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:52,230
Shunday qilaman.

570
00:34:52,253 --> 00:34:55,253
17-SAHNA: Yaponiyaga sayohat xotiralari va rejalari / Yaponiyaga sayohat xotiralari va rejalari

571
00:34:55,253 --> 00:34:59,871
Siz Yaponiyaga borganmisiz?

572
00:34:59,895 --> 00:35:04,428
Oʻtgan qishda bir marta bordim.

573
00:35:04,451 --> 00:35:06,622
Qayerga bordingiz?

574
00:35:06,645 --> 00:35:09,478
Xokkaydoga bordim.

575
00:35:09,501 --> 00:35:12,997
Xokkaydoda nima qildingiz?

576
00:35:13,021 --> 00:35:17,988
Changʻida uchdim va mazali baliqlar yedim.

577
00:35:18,011 --> 00:35:21,228
Siz changʻida uchish tajribasiga egamisiz?

578
00:35:21,252 --> 00:35:26,452
Men bolaligimdan beri changʻida uchaman.

579
00:35:26,475 --> 00:35:30,075
Men hech qachon changʻida uchmaganman.

580
00:35:30,098 --> 00:35:35,437
Qiyin emas, shuning uchun keyingi safar birga boring.

581
00:35:35,460 --> 00:35:38,993
Bu yozda ham Yaponiyaga borasizmi?

582
00:35:39,016 --> 00:35:43,216
Bu yozda Tokioga borishni xohlayman.

583
00:35:43,239 --> 00:35:45,873
Tokioda nima qilmoqchisiz?

584
00:35:45,895 --> 00:35:50,784
Eski ibodatxonalarni koʻrishni va xarid qilishni xohlayman.

585
00:35:50,808 --> 00:35:54,616
Siz Asakusa ibodatxonasiga borganmisiz?

586
00:35:54,639 --> 00:35:57,173
Hali yoʻq.

587
00:35:57,196 --> 00:36:02,277
Men uch yil oldin Asakusaga borganman.

588
00:36:02,300 --> 00:36:05,067
U yer gavjummi?

589
00:36:05,090 --> 00:36:09,857
Suratga tushirdim va sovg‘alar oldim.

590
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:12,482
Qiziqarli!

591
00:36:12,505 --> 00:36:18,871
Tokioda mazali taomlar yeying va go‘zal manzaralarni ko‘ring.

592
00:36:18,894 --> 00:36:21,928
Ko‘p sayohat qilishni xohlayman.

593
00:36:21,951 --> 00:36:24,951
18-Sahna: Yapon tili o‘rganishdagi taraqqiyot

594
00:36:24,951 --> 00:36:30,151
Siz uzoq vaqtdan beri yapon tilini o‘rganyapsiz, shundaymi?

595
00:36:30,174 --> 00:36:33,707
Ikki yildan beri o‘rganyapman.

596
00:36:33,730 --> 00:36:38,063
Gaplashishingiz juda yaxshi bo‘ldi-ku!

597
00:36:38,086 --> 00:36:39,962
Rahmat.

598
00:36:39,986 --> 00:36:44,440
Ammo kanji hali ham qiyin.

599
00:36:44,464 --> 00:36:48,443
Har kuni qanchadan-qancha o‘qiysiz?

600
00:36:48,466 --> 00:36:53,033
Har kuni bir soat o‘rganaman.

601
00:36:53,056 --> 00:36:55,623
Ajoyib!

602
00:36:55,646 --> 00:37:00,730
Kelgusi yili yanada qiyinroq bo‘ladi, deb o‘ylayman.

603
00:37:00,753 --> 00:37:04,720
Siz uchun muammo bo‘lmaydi, albatta.

604
00:37:04,743 --> 00:37:07,876
Har kuni harakat qilaman.

605
00:37:07,899 --> 00:37:12,032
Kelajakda Yaponiyada ishlashni xohlaysizmi?

606
00:37:12,055 --> 00:37:16,589
Yapon kompaniyasida ishlashni xohlayman.

607
00:37:16,612 --> 00:37:19,545
Qanday ish qilishni xohlaysiz?

608
00:37:19,568 --> 00:37:23,419
Kompyuter bilan bog‘liq ish qilishni xohlayman.

609
00:37:23,442 --> 00:37:27,331
Yaponiyada hayot qiziqarli bo‘ladi, deb o‘ylayman.

610
00:37:27,354 --> 00:37:31,721
Narxlar qimmat, shuning uchun biroz xavotirdaman.

611
00:37:31,744 --> 00:37:37,677
Tokio qimmat, lekin boshqa shaharlar arzonroq.

612
00:37:37,700 --> 00:37:40,756
Buni eshitib, yengillashdim.

613
00:37:40,780 --> 00:37:45,651
Sizning yapon tilingiz yanada yaxshilanadi, deb o‘ylayman.

614
00:37:45,674 --> 00:37:47,318
Rahmat.

615
00:37:47,342 --> 00:37:50,475
Har kuni qiyin bo‘ladi-ku?

616
00:37:50,498 --> 00:37:53,969
Kanji o‘rganish ham qiziqarli bo‘ldi.

617
00:37:53,993 --> 00:37:57,801
Kelajakda ham birga harakat qilaylik!

618
00:37:57,824 --> 00:38:00,824
19-Sahna: Vaqt va yo‘nalishni aniqlash

619
00:38:00,824 --> 00:38:05,791
Tanaka-san bugun soat nechada keladi?

620
00:38:05,814 --> 00:38:10,429
Tanaka-san soat o‘nda kelishini aytdi.

621
00:38:10,452 --> 00:38:14,419
Hozir soat o‘n yarim bo‘ldi-ku!

622
00:38:14,442 --> 00:38:16,842
Kechikdi-ku.

623
00:38:16,865 --> 00:38:20,631
Yo‘l gavjum bo‘lgani uchun bo‘lishi mumkin.

624
00:38:20,654 --> 00:38:23,929
U elektr poyezdda kelishini aytdimi?

625
00:38:23,953 --> 00:38:27,153
Mashinada kelishini aytdi.

626
00:38:27,176 --> 00:38:31,310
Yomg‘ir yog‘ganda yo‘l gavjum bo‘ladi.

627
00:38:31,333 --> 00:38:36,466
Bu yo‘l bilan to‘g‘ri borganingizda, vokzal oldiga chiqasiz.

628
00:38:36,489 --> 00:38:41,531
U burchakdan o‘tsangiz, tor yo‘l bor.

629
00:38:41,555 --> 00:38:47,034
Mashina o‘tmasa, u yo‘l juda tinch.

630
00:38:47,057 --> 00:38:51,591
Tanaka-san bu yo‘lni biladimi?

631
00:38:51,614 --> 00:38:54,385
Bilmasligini aytdi.

632
00:38:54,408 --> 00:38:57,475
Telefon qilib ko‘raylik.

633
00:38:57,498 --> 00:38:59,670
Shunday qiling.

634
00:38:59,693 --> 00:39:03,460
Alo, Tanaka-sanmi?

635
00:39:03,483 --> 00:39:06,852
Hozir qayerdasiz?

636
00:39:06,875 --> 00:39:11,209
U hozir vokzal oldida ekanligini aytdi.

637
00:39:11,232 --> 00:39:15,246
Yana besh daqiqada yetib keladi.

638
00:39:15,269 --> 00:39:19,436
Yaqin atrofdagi to‘xtash joyiga mashinani qo‘yishini aytdi.

639
00:39:19,459 --> 00:39:24,925
Bu tugmani bosganda, to‘xtash joyi eshigi ochiladi.

640
00:39:24,948 --> 00:39:28,982
Tanaka-san kelganida, eshikni ochamiz.

641
00:39:29,005 --> 00:39:33,292
Shunday qilib, biz shu yerda kutaylik.

642
00:39:33,315 --> 00:39:36,315
20-SAHNA: Sovgʻalar va Pishirish

643
00:39:36,315 --> 00:39:40,494
Bu soat juda chiroyli ekan.

644
00:39:40,518 --> 00:39:42,252
Rahmat.

645
00:39:42,275 --> 00:39:46,548
Tugʻilgan kunimda opam menga bu soatni sovgʻa qildi.

646
00:39:46,571 --> 00:39:49,844
Opangiz juda mehribon ekan.

647
00:39:49,868 --> 00:39:54,201
Men unga javoban roʻmolcha sovgʻa qildim.

648
00:39:54,224 --> 00:39:57,757
Opangiz xursand boʻldimi?

649
00:39:57,780 --> 00:40:00,597
Juda xursand boʻldi.

650
00:40:00,621 --> 00:40:04,755
Sizning pishirish mahoringiz zoʻr ekan.

651
00:40:04,778 --> 00:40:07,831
Hali yaxshi emas.

652
00:40:07,855 --> 00:40:14,666
Kecha doʻstingizga ovqat pishirib berdingizmi?

653
00:40:14,689 --> 00:40:20,135
Doʻstim uyga kelganida, unga karey pishirib berdim.

654
00:40:20,159 --> 00:40:24,032
Doʻstingiz nima dedi?

655
00:40:24,055 --> 00:40:28,588
Mazali ekanligini aytib, koʻp yedi.

656
00:40:28,611 --> 00:40:30,978
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

657
00:40:31,001 --> 00:40:35,434
Doʻstim menga shirinlik berdi.

658
00:40:35,457 --> 00:40:38,149
Qanday shirinlik?

659
00:40:38,173 --> 00:40:40,973
Fransuz shirinligi.

660
00:40:40,996 --> 00:40:45,529
Shirinlik yeb, kayfiyat koʻtariladi, shunday emasmi?

661
00:40:45,552 --> 00:40:48,885
Charchaganingizda yeb koʻrsangiz, yaxshi boʻladi.

662
00:40:48,908 --> 00:40:54,675
Men ham opamga ovqat pishirib bermoqchiman.

663
00:40:54,698 --> 00:40:58,631
Opa kelganida, birga yeyishni rejalashtiramiz.

664
00:40:58,654 --> 00:41:00,191
Rahmat.

665
00:41:00,215 --> 00:41:02,748
Opa ham xursand boʻladi.